1
00:00:06,261 --> 00:00:10,990
In Negation and Formation, freedom
turned out to be in conventions,

2
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:13,192
not a leap into silence.

3
00:00:13,272 --> 00:00:15,107
Words and names keep working.

4
00:00:15,187 --> 00:00:17,204
The painted rice cake feeds.

5
00:00:18,038 --> 00:00:20,825
I am John Tan, known as Thusness.

6
00:00:20,905 --> 00:00:25,096
These are my own notes, from my
own practice and contemplation.

7
00:00:25,914 --> 00:00:27,764
That raises two questions.

8
00:00:27,844 --> 00:00:31,772
If conventions keep working, what
exactly is the problem with them?

9
00:00:31,852 --> 00:00:35,852
And all of this is view. How
is it actually met, in a life?

10
00:00:36,657 --> 00:00:38,103
Start with the first.

11
00:00:39,242 --> 00:00:41,608
There are two ways of
knowing rightly here.

12
00:00:41,688 --> 00:00:43,419
It helps not to collapse them.

13
00:00:44,238 --> 00:00:47,772
The first works through
concepts, within the framework.

14
00:00:47,852 --> 00:00:51,305
It is how a doctor
treats, how a cook cooks,

15
00:00:51,385 --> 00:00:55,218
how a promise is kept,
how karma is understood.

16
00:00:55,298 --> 00:00:56,962
This is not a lesser knowing.

17
00:00:57,778 --> 00:01:00,918
The second is freedom
from all elaborations.

18
00:01:00,998 --> 00:01:02,712
Nothing reified is added.

19
00:01:02,792 --> 00:01:08,187
Nothing is cut into before and after,
part and whole, cause and effect.

20
00:01:08,267 --> 00:01:12,848
One complete stroke. One does not
mean one stuff. It means not cut up.

21
00:01:12,928 --> 00:01:16,575
The colour is still the colour,
and the sound is still the sound.

22
00:01:17,401 --> 00:01:19,101
Neither cancels the other.

23
00:01:19,181 --> 00:01:21,533
The first is not a ladder to throw away.

24
00:01:21,613 --> 00:01:25,206
The second is not a place
outside the world to retreat to.

25
00:01:26,021 --> 00:01:28,187
So I keep two frameworks apart.

26
00:01:29,014 --> 00:01:32,440
The default framework is the
conventional cutting itself:

27
00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:38,024
parts and whole, before and after,
cause and effect, agent and action.

28
00:01:38,104 --> 00:01:42,698
It works. We need it to speak,
to cook and to keep promises.

29
00:01:42,778 --> 00:01:44,985
Dependent arising lives here.

30
00:01:45,805 --> 00:01:50,018
The inherent framework is the habit of
taking what the cutting singles out as

31
00:01:50,098 --> 00:01:53,238
standing by itself. That is the matrix.

32
00:01:53,318 --> 00:01:56,735
Not a world, not a
field. A habit of seeing.

33
00:01:57,558 --> 00:01:59,530
The framework is not the prison.

34
00:01:59,610 --> 00:02:02,832
What binds is living in
it with reified thoughts.

35
00:02:02,912 --> 00:02:07,546
Dependent arising lives in the
first, and unbinds the second.

36
00:02:07,626 --> 00:02:12,397
Run the two together, and, dependent
arising lives in a framework,

37
00:02:12,477 --> 00:02:16,432
is heard as, dependent
arising is only a story.

38
00:02:16,512 --> 00:02:18,896
That is the slide into annihilation.

39
00:02:19,701 --> 00:02:22,420
So the framework can be held three ways.

40
00:02:22,500 --> 00:02:24,811
Without it: one complete stroke.

41
00:02:24,891 --> 00:02:28,235
Within it, with the wisdom
of dependent arising:

42
00:02:28,315 --> 00:02:31,346
the same parts and conditions, now light.

43
00:02:31,426 --> 00:02:35,930
And in between, where we mostly
live: within it, reified.

44
00:02:36,745 --> 00:02:40,292
Have a second thought. If you
think you do not think inherently,

45
00:02:40,372 --> 00:02:42,847
have a second thought. Toss an apple.

46
00:02:42,927 --> 00:02:45,646
Is it simply there,
before any thought at all?

47
00:02:45,726 --> 00:02:47,765
For almost all of us, it is.

48
00:02:47,845 --> 00:02:49,464
That is the habit at work.

49
00:02:49,544 --> 00:02:51,135
It does not feel like a view.

50
00:02:51,215 --> 00:02:53,146
It feels like the world itself.

51
00:02:53,226 --> 00:02:56,982
So agreeing with dependent
arising is not living in it.

52
00:02:57,797 --> 00:03:00,710
Which brings the second
question. How is it met?

53
00:03:01,561 --> 00:03:05,367
For me, dependent arising
did not come first as a view.

54
00:03:05,447 --> 00:03:09,090
It came as a taste, and the
view came to sync with it later.

55
00:03:09,170 --> 00:03:14,172
Looked back on, the taste was met
three times. Right after anatta.

56
00:03:14,252 --> 00:03:16,971
Again when every hinge was exhausted.

57
00:03:17,051 --> 00:03:18,836
And again in the marketplace.

58
00:03:19,645 --> 00:03:23,980
Right after anatta, there
is only seeing, no seer.

59
00:03:24,060 --> 00:03:28,047
But then, what are seeing and
hearing? Look, in real time.

60
00:03:28,865 --> 00:03:34,736
Seeing is just colours. No effort at all.
Hearing is just sound. No effort at all.

61
00:03:34,816 --> 00:03:38,758
Nothing is doing the seeing, and
the seeing is not being done.

62
00:03:38,838 --> 00:03:44,210
Nothing runs underneath the colours,
carrying them from one moment to the next.

63
00:03:45,021 --> 00:03:46,721
And the colours are not dark.

64
00:03:46,801 --> 00:03:49,234
They are clear, known and vivid.

65
00:03:49,314 --> 00:03:51,286
The knowing is right there in the colour,

66
00:03:51,366 --> 00:03:54,089
and nothing stands behind it, knowing.

67
00:03:54,889 --> 00:03:58,233
How is this different from
a refined non-dual state?

68
00:03:58,313 --> 00:04:01,249
A refined non-dual rests in oneness.

69
00:04:01,329 --> 00:04:04,034
Everything is made of one luminosity.

70
00:04:04,114 --> 00:04:08,287
The seer has merged, but the one it
merged into is still a something.

71
00:04:08,367 --> 00:04:10,923
Anatta finds no seer there to merge.

72
00:04:11,003 --> 00:04:13,368
So in this taste there is no made of.

73
00:04:13,448 --> 00:04:16,942
The colour is clear as
colour, with light and eye.

74
00:04:17,022 --> 00:04:20,597
The sound is clear as
sound, with air and ear.

75
00:04:20,677 --> 00:04:23,450
Six clarities, one for each stream.

76
00:04:23,530 --> 00:04:25,683
Not one lamp lighting them all.

77
00:04:26,514 --> 00:04:30,646
The taste widens. Each event
seems to spend itself completely.

78
00:04:30,726 --> 00:04:33,744
The sound of a car going
by is wholly the sound,

79
00:04:33,824 --> 00:04:36,040
with nothing behind it holding back.

80
00:04:36,120 --> 00:04:41,801
Dōgen called this total exertion:
firewood in its own place, ash in its own.

81
00:04:41,881 --> 00:04:44,940
Not the whole cosmos
packed into each moment.

82
00:04:45,020 --> 00:04:47,159
Just this, spent completely.

83
00:04:47,974 --> 00:04:49,937
But a taste is not yet freedom.

84
00:04:50,749 --> 00:04:55,574
While I see a flower, the seeing is
just colours, with no one behind it.

85
00:04:55,654 --> 00:04:59,894
Yet the moment I turn away, the flower
is still assumed to be sitting there by

86
00:04:59,974 --> 00:05:02,625
itself, its red belonging to it.

87
00:05:02,705 --> 00:05:05,451
A cause is still felt to push its effect.

88
00:05:05,531 --> 00:05:07,775
Death is still the end of a someone.

89
00:05:07,855 --> 00:05:11,203
The self had dissolved,
but the universe had not.

90
00:05:12,098 --> 00:05:15,293
For years after anatta,
the taste was there,

91
00:05:15,373 --> 00:05:19,491
and the view still treated each
thing as standing by itself.

92
00:05:19,571 --> 00:05:22,553
That gap is what I call
the desynchronisation.

93
00:05:23,386 --> 00:05:25,589
The habit does not announce itself.

94
00:05:25,669 --> 00:05:29,692
It is only when it is challenged by
Nāgārjuna's verses that it comes to the

95
00:05:29,772 --> 00:05:33,157
surface. The logic points
to the place to look.

96
00:05:33,237 --> 00:05:35,806
Then I look, and check
it against the taste.

97
00:05:35,886 --> 00:05:39,325
Insight without the logic
drifts back into nouns.

98
00:05:39,405 --> 00:05:43,474
Logic without the taste stays
a clever argument about words.

99
00:05:44,281 --> 00:05:47,901
Before freedom, the mind will
always hinge on something.

100
00:05:47,990 --> 00:05:49,731
First it hinges on parts.

101
00:05:49,811 --> 00:05:52,991
When the parts are seen
through, it hinges on the whole.

102
00:05:53,071 --> 00:05:58,915
When the whole is seen through, it finds
something finer to stand on. Qi. Energy.

103
00:05:58,995 --> 00:06:02,135
A field. Relations. A substrate.

104
00:06:02,215 --> 00:06:05,102
Each time, it is looking for a foundation.

105
00:06:05,922 --> 00:06:08,302
The tools meet each hinge in turn.

106
00:06:08,382 --> 00:06:12,242
When all of these are exhausted,
neither parts nor whole,

107
00:06:12,322 --> 00:06:17,717
with nothing left to hinge on, the mind
becomes free from all elaborations,

108
00:06:17,797 --> 00:06:22,649
and in a stable way. Stable does not
mean the habit can never stir again.

109
00:06:22,729 --> 00:06:25,951
When it stirs, it is
met by the same seeing,

110
00:06:26,031 --> 00:06:27,681
and it does not take root.

111
00:06:28,497 --> 00:06:31,909
Then appearance is again
tasted as vividly present,

112
00:06:31,989 --> 00:06:34,001
spontaneous and free.

113
00:06:34,081 --> 00:06:36,623
It is the first taste, revisited.

114
00:06:36,703 --> 00:06:40,142
What has changed is its
reach, now covering thought,

115
00:06:40,222 --> 00:06:43,281
the body, causes, time and death.

116
00:06:43,361 --> 00:06:46,560
And its stability: it no
longer depends on looking.

117
00:06:47,365 --> 00:06:51,823
After freedom from all elaborations,
I re-enter the marketplace,

118
00:06:51,903 --> 00:06:53,607
and dirty my hands.

119
00:06:54,438 --> 00:06:57,089
The marketplace is ordinary life.

120
00:06:57,169 --> 00:07:02,809
Work, family, money, arguments,
other people's troubles, choices.

121
00:07:02,889 --> 00:07:06,206
The last of the Zen
ox-herding pictures shows it:

122
00:07:06,286 --> 00:07:11,668
barefoot, smeared with mud and ashes, he
comes into the market with helping hands,

123
00:07:11,748 --> 00:07:13,126
smiling broadly.

124
00:07:13,968 --> 00:07:16,564
Here dependent arising changes its role.

125
00:07:16,644 --> 00:07:20,043
Before, it was the tool
that took each hinge apart.

126
00:07:20,123 --> 00:07:22,882
Now I deal in causes
and conditions all day.

127
00:07:22,962 --> 00:07:26,293
What helps, what harms,
what follows from what.

128
00:07:26,373 --> 00:07:28,987
Dependent arising is how help works.

129
00:07:29,822 --> 00:07:31,971
Who decides, if no one is there?

130
00:07:32,051 --> 00:07:33,696
Nobody disappears.

131
00:07:33,776 --> 00:07:38,696
I still act, choose, keep my
promises and answer for what I do,

132
00:07:38,776 --> 00:07:40,462
as a conventional person.

133
00:07:40,542 --> 00:07:44,348
What is gone is the doer behind
the doing, pulling the levers.

134
00:07:44,428 --> 00:07:48,125
No one is there, so nothing
matters, is not freedom.

135
00:07:48,205 --> 00:07:49,991
It is the annihilation view.

136
00:07:50,813 --> 00:07:53,545
And why help, if others are not found?

137
00:07:53,625 --> 00:07:56,847
Others suffer, validly, in dependence.

138
00:07:56,927 --> 00:08:00,108
Their suffering is eased
when its conditions change.

139
00:08:00,188 --> 00:08:04,021
And looked for, no one is found
suffering from their own side,

140
00:08:04,101 --> 00:08:06,484
so nothing in it is fixed for good.

141
00:08:07,305 --> 00:08:12,999
So, looked back on, the taste has been
met three times. These are not stages.

142
00:08:13,079 --> 00:08:15,458
The logic does not produce the taste.

143
00:08:15,538 --> 00:08:17,143
It unbinds the habit.

144
00:08:17,223 --> 00:08:19,344
And it is not a ladder climbed once.

145
00:08:19,424 --> 00:08:23,452
It goes round again, wherever
the habit of fixing returns.

146
00:08:24,277 --> 00:08:26,534
And the taste has three descriptions.

147
00:08:26,614 --> 00:08:28,993
Anatta: no one is behind it.

148
00:08:29,073 --> 00:08:32,716
Dependent arising: nothing
in it stands on its own.

149
00:08:32,796 --> 00:08:36,031
Spontaneous presence: nothing is missing,

150
00:08:36,111 --> 00:08:37,852
and nothing is making it.

151
00:08:37,932 --> 00:08:41,049
Three angles on one face. None is higher.

152
00:08:41,849 --> 00:08:45,804
No one behind it. Nothing
standing alone. Nothing missing.

153
00:08:45,884 --> 00:08:51,325
Met in the colours, in the hinges, and
in the marketplace, with dirty hands.

